#### VALIDATION 1: GR (alpha=beta=lam=0) ####
==============================================================================
CASE: GR
   tau-equation residual (must be 0): 0
   G_N/G   = 1
   gamma_PPN = 1
   alpha_2          = 0
   alpha_1 - alpha_3 = 0
   alpha_1 - alpha_2 (from g_0x, gauge-invariant) = 0
   ==> alpha_1 = 0
   ==> alpha_2 = 0
   ==> alpha_3 = 0

